        "## MediaForge Timeline — MiniMax H3 director (single node)\n\n1. Pick your H3 models in the loaders: fl2va UNet (+ optional turbo LoRA), the Qwen3-VL text encoder (`type = minimax`), the **video** VAE and the **audio** VAE. Sample Segments needs `audio_vae` here because the timeline locks an audio clip.\n2. The three materials in **⏱️ Edit Timeline** are placeholders: put your own `nurse.png`, `walk.mp4` and `line1.wav` into `input/mediaforge_timeline/`, or select a card in the material library and point its file at one of yours. Plan: `nurse` (image) is a reference in both segments, `walk` (video) is a reference in segment 1 and a 22-frame guide in segment 2, `line1` (audio) is locked at frames 12–72. Segment 2 has an empty prompt, so it uses the global prompt.\n3. Queue. 🎛️ Sample Segments expands into Encode H3 Segment → Extend Latent → core guider + SamplerCustomAdvanced → Append Segment for each segment; 🧵 Assemble Segments writes one MP4 and, with `lock_audio = original`, puts the original `line1` audio back over frames 12–72.\n\nPlan: 2 × 107 frames, overlap 22 → **192 frames**. Batch 1 only. Seams are not guaranteed to be invisible.\n\n---\n1. 在載入器選好 H3 模型：fl2va UNet（可加 turbo LoRA）、Qwen3-VL text encoder（`type = minimax`）、**video** VAE 與 **audio** VAE。時間軸上有鎖定原音，所以 Sample Segments 必須接 `audio_vae`。\n2. **⏱️ Edit Timeline** 的三個素材是佔位：把自己的 `nurse.png`、`walk.mp4`、`line1.wav` 放進 `input/mediaforge_timeline/`，或在素材庫選取卡片、把檔案改成自己的。計畫：`nurse`（圖片）是兩段的參考，`walk`（影片）是第 1 段的參考與第 2 段 22 幀的錨定片段，`line1`（音訊）鎖定在第 12–72 幀。第 2 段 prompt 空白，沿用全域 prompt。\n3. 執行。🎛️ Sample Segments 逐段展開成 Encode H3 Segment → Extend Latent → core guider + SamplerCustomAdvanced → Append Segment；🧵 Assemble Segments 輸出一個 MP4，`lock_audio = original` 時第 12–72 幀換回 `line1` 原聲。\n\n計畫：2 × 107 幀、重疊 22 → **192 幀**。只支援 batch 1；不保證接縫無痕。"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
